---
// Interactive batch memory & distributed shuffle simulator: wraps BatchShuffleDemo
// in DemoFrame with caption and scoped styles using unique prefix btc-.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import BatchShuffleDemo from '../demos/BatchShuffleDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="btc-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Memory spill vs. OOM, and hot-key shuffle skew" titleVi="Tràn RAM vs. xả đĩa, và lệch tải (skew) khi shuffle">
    <BatchShuffleDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Simulated numbers based on a 10M-row log (128 MiB cgroup RAM cap, 32 MiB external sort buffer) and a 1M-event join with an 8 MB user table across 4 workers. Real Spark and Flink executors also enable Adaptive Query Execution (AQE) to split hot partitions or switch to broadcast joins automatically at runtime.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đây là mô phỏng dựa trên log 10 triệu dòng (giới hạn RAM cgroup 128 MiB, bộ đệm sort ngoài RAM 32 MiB) và phép join 1 triệu sự kiện với bảng user 8 MB trên 4 worker. Spark và Flink thực tế còn có Adaptive Query Execution (AQE) để tự động chẻ nhỏ phân mảnh nóng hoặc chuyển sang broadcast join ngay lúc đang chạy.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .btc-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .btc-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .btc-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .btc-sr {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btc .sd-group > span,
  .btc .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .btc .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .btc-msg {
    min-height: 2.8em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .btc-msg.is-bad {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .btc-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .btc-box {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .btc-box.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .btc-box-head {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .btc-box-foot {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .btc-box-empty {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .btc-bar-track {
    width: 100%;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .btc-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--text-muted);
    transition: width 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btc-bar-fill.is-bad {
    background: var(--red);
  }
  .btc-runs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .btc-run {
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .btc-run.is-more {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-style: dashed;
  }
  .btc-workers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .btc-worker {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .btc-worker.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .btc-worker-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .btc-worker-time {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .btc-worker.is-bad .btc-worker-time {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .btc-worker-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .btc-tag {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .btc-tag.is-bad {
    color: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
